flowchart TB
  A([Start]) --> B[Open map / browse issues]
  B --> C{Authenticated?}
  C -- No --> D[Login / Register] --> E[Report an Issue]
  C -- Yes --> E
  E --> F[Choose location: GPS / map click / place search]
  F --> G{Location available?}
  G -- No --> H[Fallback: manual map selection / coordinates] --> I[Enter category + description + optional image]
  G -- Yes --> I
  I --> J{Input valid?}
  J -- No --> K[Show errors; preserve input] --> I
  J -- Yes --> L[Submit report]
  L --> M[Find nearby similar open issues]
  M --> N{Candidate issue found?}
  N -- Yes --> O[Attach report to existing issue]
  N -- No --> P[Create new issue + attach report]
  O --> Q[Persist in Neon transaction]
  P --> Q
  Q --> R[Return result; update map and My Reports]
  R --> S([Done])
